        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Solid Brass Accents Door Push Plates</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nPull plates are 16 ga. (.050) wrought and standard in all metals and finishes. Plates come packed with stainless steel sheet metal screws, plated to match the piece's finish.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nBrass Accents provides distinctive craftsmanship with old-world tradition for a lifetime of elegance. Their products are hand finished in the USA. They are one of the worlds leading crafters of cast-brass and hot-forged decorative brass hardware.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available Plates Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>A07-P6320: 3\" Wide, 12\" High</li>\r\n<li>A07-P6340: 3-1/2\" Wide, 15\" High</li>\r\n<li>A07-P6350: 4\" Wide, 16\" High</li>\r\n<li>Material: Solid Brass </li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso Available: <b>\r\n<a href=\"/products/solid-brass-door-pull-plates-brass-accents\">Brass Door Pull Plate</a>\r\n</b>\r\n</p>",
